's very likely. We can't be the only ones who want information...though our fellow stalker is probably no friend of ours."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635-NoArmor","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod-Noarmor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No matter who they are, we can't let them get their hands on the maid!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635-NoArmor","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod-Noarmor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're right. We should locate our competitor and get rid of them before they notice our presence."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635-NoArmor","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod-Noarmor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Do you want a tip?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635-NoArmor","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod-Noarmor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You know something?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635-NoArmor","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod-Noarmor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I just accessed the public network through another Doll. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That way, I could widen our search parameters and keep an eye out for any suspicious persons around."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635-NoArmor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod-Noarmor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"le